          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Express each of the following as a product of powers of their prime factors in exponential form. (i) 648 (ii) 405 (iii) 540 (iv) 3600"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.154,
            0.817,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. Write the numerical value of each of the following: (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 \\times 1 0 ^ { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "7 ^ { 2 } \\times 2 ^ { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) 3 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\times   4 ^ { 4 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iv) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( - 3 ) ^ { 2 } \\times ( - 5 ) ^ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (v) "
